+## Categories of test cases
+
+### I. Pointer levels
+
+- Single-level pointers (T\*)
+- Multi-level pointers (T**, T\***, etc.)
+
+### II. Scope of sensitive pointers
+
+1. Local (function) scope
+   - Local variables
+   - Function arguments
+     - Fixed arguments
+     - Variable arguments
+   - Function return values
+2. Global scope
+   - Initialized
+   - Uninitialized
+3. Heap scope
+4. Thread-local storage
+
+### III. Pointer types
+
+1. Pointers to primitive data types
+   - Pointers to integer types (signed/unsigned: char, short, int, long, long long)
+   - Pointers to floating point types (float, double, long double)
+   - Pointers to void
+2. Pointers to complex data types
+   - Pointers to structs
+   - Pointers to unions
+   - Pointers to arrays (T(\*)[])
+     - Fixed-size arrays
+     - Variable-length arrays
+   - Function pointers
+3. Pointer as members
+   - Struct members
+   - Union members
+   - Array elements
+   - Function prototype members
+
+### IV. Compatibility with C qualifiers/specifiers
+
+1. No qualifiers
+2. Type qualifiers
+   - const
+   - volatile
+   - restrict
+   - \_Atomic
+3. Storage class specifiers
+   - register
+   - static
+   - extern
+   - typedef
+   - auto
+4. Function specifiers
+   - inline
+
+### V. Pointer operations
+
+1. Assignment/Dereference
+2. Arithmetic
+   - Increment/decrement
+   - Array indexing
+3. AddrOf
+4. Arrow, period
+5. Comparison (==, !=, <, >, <=, >=)
+6. Type casting
+   - Implicit and explicit conversions
+   - From/to void \*
+   - From/to pointer types
+     - Sensitive from/to sensitive pointers
+     - Sensitive from/to insensitive pointers
+7. Macro expansion
+
+### VI. Optimization levels
+
+1. O0
+2. O1
+3. O2
+4. O3
+5. Ofast
+6. Os
+7. Oz
+8. Og
+
+### VII. Inline assembly
+
+1. Inline assembly code
